  "releaseNotes": "'## [10.3.5](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/compare/v10.3.4...v10.3.5) (2026-04-21)\n\n### ⚠ BREAKING CHANGES\n\n* **operator:** decouple ResourceWatcher from Reconciler via queue-based dispatch pipeline (#1060)\n\n### Dependencies\n\n* **core:** update spectre-console monorepo to 0.55.1 ([#1087](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1087)) ([8ea689d](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/8ea689d7ff54c1bb308619edfa82e69a645a8841))\n* **core:** update spectre-console monorepo to 0.55.2 ([#1089](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1089)) ([d1554c1](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/d1554c1e371655a78a54ca94dc3d1c18c1fb656a))\n* **test:** update dependency coverlet.collector to v10 ([#1091](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1091)) ([fb48686](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/fb4868627b5b0f20bc7e5dcf64ca29f67d35a050))\n* **test:** update dependency microsoft.extensions.timeprovider.testing to 10.5.0 ([#1090](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1090)) ([5d4eea8](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/5d4eea8a04cb0784925f3bd3abcb8efe53e3a5ac))\n* **test:** update dotnet monorepo ([#1086](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1086)) ([dd6d885](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/dd6d885dca2a89c2fcc39a82525303a38a30703c))\n\n### Code Refactoring\n\n* **operator:** decouple ResourceWatcher from Reconciler via queue-based dispatch pipeline ([#1060](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1060)) ([6313f82](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/6313f82bb59b98248e788dd87b8eb1c959e1a5fa))\n'",
